              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 12.11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they set up a tent for Absalom on the palace roof, and in the sight of everyone Absalom went in and had intercourse with his father's concubines.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
